            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "matters arise the HKU LR representative shall facilitate the meeting request. The Union shall provide, in writing, the reason or purpose of the meeting, an agenda (if applicable), a list of attendees, and proposed dates, times, and location. The Agency shall provide the Union a reply concerning their request to meet with the Adjutant General within seven (7) days of receiving such a request. If the request for a meeting is declined, an explanation shall be furbished to the Union.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
